graph TB
    subgraph External
        MYP[MYP Cards Website<br>HTML + JSON-LD]
    end

    subgraph Data Collection Pipeline
        CurlCFFI[curl_cffi<br>HTTP client - raw bytes]
        Provider[MYP Provider<br>Forces UTF-8 decode]
        Parser[MYP Parser<br>BeautifulSoup extraction]
    end

    subgraph Storage
        SQLite[(SQLite Database<br>cards / source_cards / price_observations)]
    end

    subgraph API Layer
        FastAPI[FastAPI REST API<br>/api/v1/*]
    end

    subgraph Frontend
        React[React SPA<br>Dashboard, Cards, Detail, Movers]
    end

    MYP -->|HTTP response bytes| CurlCFFI
    CurlCFFI -->|raw bytes| Provider
    Provider -->|UTF-8 decoded HTML| Parser
    Parser -->|domain models| SQLite

    SQLite --> FastAPI
    FastAPI -->|JSON envelope| React

    %% Encoding fix highlight
    style Provider fill:#2d6a4f,stroke:#40916c,color:#d8f3dc

    subgraph Migration Path
        direction LR
        DBMojibake[(DB with mojibake<br>double-encoded names)]
        FixScript[fix_encoding.py<br>detect + repair UTF-8]
        DBFixed[(DB with correct<br>UTF-8 names)]
    end

    DBMojibake -->|scan all card names| FixScript
    FixScript -->|UPDATE corrected names| DBFixed

    style FixScript fill:#e76f51,stroke:#f4a261,color:#fff
    style DBMojibake fill:#6c757d,stroke:#adb5bd,color:#fff
    style DBFixed fill:#2d6a4f,stroke:#40916c,color:#d8f3dc
